---
import { SHOW_BUILD_NOTES } from '../data/build-notes';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base title="XPEL Window Tint — Airborne Dent Repair" description="XPEL window tint in Gunter, Texas, installed exclusively with XPEL film and backed by the manufacturer's warranty. Free estimate." nav="Services" css="retail">
<main>
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Window Tint</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">XPEL.<br>Only XPEL.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">Window tint in Gunter, Texas, installed with XPEL film exclusively and backed by the manufacturer's warranty. Free estimate.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Free estimates</li><li>Veteran owned</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure" style="--hero:url('/img/card-window-tint.jpg')">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">Customer vehicle &middot; Airborne Dent Repair</span>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">In Plain Terms</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">Most Tint Complaints Are Film Complaints.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">Purple edges. Bubbling along the top of the door glass. A haze that only shows up against oncoming headlights. That is cheap film aging badly — not, in most cases, a bad installation.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">We install XPEL and nothing else. One film line, known well, carrying the manufacturer's own warranty — which means every car that leaves here has the same film on it as the last one did.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">The Short Version</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Film</dt><dd>XPEL, exclusively</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Warranty</dt><dd>XPEL manufacturer's warranty</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Estimate</dt><dd>Free</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>In-shop, Gunter</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="border-top:1px solid var(--hair)">
  <div class="wrap sec-head">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Proof</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Damage Was Real.</h2>
    <p class="prose rv rv-d2">Every photograph on this site is a vehicle that came through our bay. Drag the handle.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ba-feature ba-half rv rv-d1">
      <div class="ba" data-ba style="--split:50%">
        <div class="ba-layer ba-before" style="background-image:url('/img/tint-01-before.jpg')"><span class="ba-tag">Before</span></div>
        <div class="ba-layer ba-after" style="background-image:url('/img/tint-01-after.jpg')"><span class="ba-tag">After</span></div>
        <div class="ba-handle"></div>
        <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" step="0.1" aria-label="Reveal the repaired vehicle">
      </div>
      <div class="ba-cap"><span>XPEL window tint &mdash; before and after</span><span>Drag &rarr;</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap detail">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Detail</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 0;max-width:18ch">What Tint Actually Does.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="detail-list rv rv-d1">
      <li>
        <strong>Heat, not just darkness</strong>
        <span>Rejecting infrared is what keeps a parked car survivable in a Texas August. How dark a film looks and how much heat it stops are two different specifications, and they do not always move together.</span>
        
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>There is a legal limit</strong>
        <span>Texas regulates how much light the front side windows have to let through, and where a windshield strip is allowed to start. We will walk you through what is legal before anything gets cut.</span>
        {SHOW_BUILD_NOTES && <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: VLT options offered</span>}
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Which XPEL line</strong>
        <span>XPEL makes several tint films at different price and performance points.</span>
        {SHOW_BUILD_NOTES && <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: XPEL film lines offered</span>}
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Paint protection film</strong>
        <span>XPEL is as well known for clear paint protection film as it is for tint.</span>
        {SHOW_BUILD_NOTES && <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: XPEL PPF offered as well as tint</span>}
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Cure time</strong>
        <span>Film needs a few days to fully clear and the windows stay up while it does. A little haze early on is normal and goes away.</span>
        
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">How It Goes</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Four Steps.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps steps-4">
  <div class="step rv rv-d0">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>Free estimate</h3>
    <p>Call or bring it by and we will quote the vehicle.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>Pick the film</h3>
    <p>What it needs to do, and what the law allows on the front glass.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>The install</h3>
    <p>In-shop, in controlled conditions. Dust is the enemy of a clean install.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d3">
    <p class="n">04</p>
    <h3>The first few days</h3>
    <p>Windows stay up while the film cures. Then it is warranted by XPEL.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="gallery">
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d0"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A matte grey Ram TRX" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-ram-trx.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Ram TRX</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d1"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A white Rolls-Royce Dawn in the shop" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-rolls-royce-dawn.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Rolls-Royce Dawn</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d2"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A black Mercedes-AMG GLE 63" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-amg-gle63.jpg')"></span><figcaption>AMG GLE 63</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d3"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A black Mercedes-AMG G 63" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-amg-g63-front.jpg')"></span><figcaption>AMG G 63</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Also In The Bay</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Other Three.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="others">
  <a class="other rv" href="/hail-damage-repair">
    <h3>Hail Damage Repair</h3>
    <p>Whole-storm damage or a single dented panel, repaired without touching the factory paint.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/paintless-dent-repair">
    <h3>Paintless Dent &amp; Door Ding Repair</h3>
    <p>Door dings, creases and transport damage — no filler, no paint, lifetime warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/windshield-replacement">
    <h3>Windshield &amp; Glass</h3>
    <p>Replacement at your home or workplace, or in the shop. Your call.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
</div>
<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>
<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Gunter, Texas &middot; Serving DFW &amp; North Texas</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Get A Free Estimate.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Request an estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
